e": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [243.083740234375, 340.7202453613281], "pos": [432.0130615234375, 2966.078369140625], "widgets_values": ["A hyper-realistic, full-body vertical portrait of an exquisite young East Asian woman in a luxurious Gothic-Lolita fashion ensemble, seated gracefully with her upper body angled slightly toward the camera and her left hand raised elegantly to frame her face, fingers delicately curled in a soft, alluring pose. She wears a breathtaking black lace corset dress featuring a sweetheart neckline adorned with intricate floral lace appliqués, a satin ribbon bow at the bust, and ornate gold baroque embroidery cascading down the front bodice, paired with a ruffled velvet mini-skirt layered with sheer tulle and scattered fine glitter for a shimmering texture. Her arms are encased in matching sheer black lace elbow-length gloves with ruffled cuffs, complemented by a matching black lace choker necklace with a single teardrop pearl pendant. Her long, wavy dark hair is crowned with a lavish floral headpiece of alternating black and soft blush-pink roses with realistic green leaves. Her makeup is flawlessly applied with doll-like large expressive eyes, winged eyeliner, subtle freckles across her nose and cheeks, glossy nude-pink lips, and a soft, dreamy gaze that conveys gentle confidence. The lighting is soft cinematic studio lighting with warm key light from the left, creating gentle highlights on her skin, collarbones, and hair, while soft shadows define her features and fabric folds. The background is a lush, romantic bokeh garden filled with out-of-focus pink and cream roses, evoking a vintage, ethereal atmosphere. The composition uses a shallow depth of field with an 85mm portrait lens, centering the subject sharply against a creamy, blurred floral backdrop, with slight tilt for dynamic elegance. The color palette is dominated by rich black tones contrasted with soft rose pinks and pale golds, creating a moody yet romantic aesthetic. Textures are rendered with photorealistic precision: satin sheen on the corset, velvet softness, lace delicacy, skin translucency, and hair gloss. The overall mood is sophisticated, mysterious, and enchanting, reminiscent of high-fashion editorial photography with a touch of fairytale romance and dark elegance."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 11724, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 171, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.6", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["```\n|欢迎关注我的主页|AI小学徒\n有超多实用的工作流进行分享，你也可以评论告诉我想要的工作流，我会尽可能去实现\n```\n---\n\n### RH主页直达：[AI小学徒](https://www.runninghub.cn/user-center/1862343910537273346/webapp?inviteCode=1ac7d3f2 )👈\n### 下面是一些常用工作流\n### 实用工作流直达：[电商融图打光Flux2模型](https://www.runninghub.cn/post/2019299607712370689 )👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[产品精修](https://www.runninghub.cn/post/1946789807444881409 )👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[高清放大](https://www.runninghub.cn/post/1950100460037390337 )👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[皮肤还原](https://www.runninghub.cn/ai-detail/1991358082580328449 )👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[动作迁移](https://www.runninghub.cn/ai-detail/1991572773659222018)👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[影调模仿](https://www.runninghub.cn/ai-detail/2001301024411447297)👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[白膜渲染](https://www.runninghub.cn/post/1974672182938873858)👈\n\n点击以上链接即可。\n持续更新中~感谢大家支持🥰。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [355.9222412109375, 534.1090087890625], "pos": [-511.4268493652344, 2161.333984375], "id": 246, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "widget_ue_connectable":